Q: http://localhost:port always redirecting to https://localhost A: <p>In my case, I found the following snippet in C:\Windows\System32\inetsrv\config\applicationHost.config, and had to comment it out to prevent redirections :</p>
<pre class="lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;rewrite&gt;
    &lt;globalRules&gt;
        &lt;rule name=&quot;LowerCaseRule1&quot; stopProcessing=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
            &lt;match url=&quot;[A-Z]&quot; ignoreCase=&quot;false&quot; /&gt;
            &lt;action type=&quot;Redirect&quot; url=&quot;{ToLower:{URL}}&quot; /&gt;
        &lt;/rule&gt;
        &lt;rule name=&quot;HTTPS Redirect&quot; stopProcessing=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
            &lt;match url=&quot;(.*)&quot; /&gt;
            &lt;conditions&gt;
                &lt;add input=&quot;{HTTPS}&quot; pattern=&quot;^OFF$&quot; /&gt;
            &lt;/conditions&gt;
            &lt;action type=&quot;Redirect&quot; url=&quot;https://{HTTP_HOST}/{REQUEST_URI}&quot; appendQueryString=&quot;false&quot; /&gt;
        &lt;/rule&gt;
    &lt;/globalRules&gt;
&lt;/rewrite&gt;
</code></pre>

Q: How to use an Anthropic API Key for the Claude Code VS Code extension instead of signing in? A: <p>I know its a really bad practice but I got it working by setting this into <code>~/.claude/settings.json</code></p>
<pre><code>{
  &quot;apiKeyHelper&quot;: &quot;echo sk-ant-...&quot;
}
</code></pre>
